ed On  08 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 06 58 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and no designation as to site  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm aggregate of soft tan cores of tissue which are submitted in toto in cassette A  Gross Description by  Joe Serra Resident  RHONDA YANTISS  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH OUTPATIENT  OFF P CLINIC  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Priscilla Slanetz  M D  James Joseph Dineen  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT BREAST   CORE BIOPSY , Unchecked.
